# bootstrapped dev API key — never commit
.inferbolt-dev/

# Claude Code configuration. The charter, context docs, workflows, templates and
# agent/command definitions ship: they document how this repo is meant to be
# worked on, and are as useful to a human contributor as to an assistant.
#
# Session memory and the knowledge bank do not ship. memory/ is working notes
# (current state, interview and learning progress); knowledge/ is personal
# study material. Neither is project documentation.
# Their READMEs ship so the charter's instructions still resolve for a fresh
# clone; the notes themselves are per-contributor working state.
.claude/memory/*
!.claude/memory/README.md
.claude/knowledge/*
!.claude/knowledge/README.md

.claude/settings.local.json